// Library.AilangDoc.ailang
// In-house document IR. Paper in points is the contract. UTF-8 run is the
// typewriter body. Not pixels, not TextBuffer, not Auckland HTML.
// Copyright © 2026 Sean Collins, 2 Paws Machine and Engineering. SCSL.

LibraryImport.Arena
LibraryImport.Display.Render.Fonts

// Paper ids match PageSurface.PaperType. FREE is not a document size.
